&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMark1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;＊１　日本自動車工業会統計より算出　　＊２　日本自動車輸入組合統計より算出&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMark1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;＊３　日本自動車販売協会連合会統計より算出　　＊４　全国軽自動車協会連合会統計より算出&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMark1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;＊５　日本自動車販売協会連合会統計の輸出抹消登録台数より試算&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
